    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. the thing that made me *me* is gone. my ability to move, the grace, the purpose... that's not coming back. it's not just a 'symptom.' it's like the soul of the person left when the body broke. how am i supposed to just live in this thing when the person who was supposed to inhabit it is already gone? it just feels like i'm haunting my own skin.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
